  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f424be585f9e04c79a96c8292e8b9db1, type: 3}
  m_Name: Evento_EmpresaDeTecnologiaSeInstala
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: Empresa de Tecnologia se Instala
  _titleEn: Tech Company Moves In
  _category: 1
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "A chegada de uma grande empresa traz empregos qualificados e arrecada\xE7\xE3o,
    e as cidades disputam essas sedes com incentivos."
  _summaryEn: A large company's arrival brings skilled jobs and revenue, and cities
    compete for these offices with incentives.
  _realWorld: "Em 2018, centenas de cidades disputaram a segunda sede da Amazon;
    o plano de instala\xE7\xE3o em Nova York foi abandonado em 2019 depois da oposi\xE7\xE3o
    aos incentivos."
  _realWorldEn: In 2018, hundreds of cities competed for Amazon's second headquarters;
    the plan for New York was dropped in 2019 after opposition to the incentives.
  _tradeOffs: "Incentivos generosos demais podem custar mais que o retorno, e a valoriza\xE7\xE3o
    encarece a moradia."
  _tradeOffsEn: Overly generous incentives can cost more than they return, and rising
    values make housing more expensive.
  _sources:
  - Label: Amazon HQ2 (Wikipedia)
    Url: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Amazon_HQ2
